{"ref":"BDB, מְגוֹרָה","hw":"מְגוֹרָה","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">מְגוֹרָה</span>]</big>  <strong>n.f. fear, terror</strong>—cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְגוֹרַת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.24\">Pr 10:24</a>; pl. sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְגוּרוֹתַי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 34:5\" href=\"/Psalms.34.5\">ψ 34:5</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מְגוּרֹתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 66:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.66.4\">Is 66:4</a> (on these forms with <span dir=\"rtl\">וּ</span> cf. Ges<sup>§ 27. 3. R. 1. & 85, 48</sup>);—<em>terror</em> (= thing dreaded) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 34:5\" href=\"/Psalms.34.5\">ψ 34:5</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:24\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.24\">Pr 10:24</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 66:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.66.4\">Is 66:4</a>.","next":"BDB, גורן","prev":"BDB, מָגוֹר²"}